values ('bbbb0004-0000-4000-8000-000000000028', 'en', null, 'Physics: Problem-Solving Mastery', 'A workshop in how to actually attack physics problems — read the situation, pick a principle, carry the units, and sanity-check the limits — across mechanics, oscillations, waves, circuits, and fields. Structure adapted from the University of Cambridge''s Isaac Physics (isaacphysics.org); all explanations original.', null, 'exam', 38, true, 'science', '{bbbb0004-0000-4000-8000-000000000005}')
on conflict (id) do nothing;

